Purpose: Register Corvid's software authenticator as the platform (internal) discovery on Linux and Windows-without-Hello.
Area: passkeys
Files: device/fido/fido_discovery_factory.cc (kInternal case of Create), device/fido/BUILD.gn (dep on //corvid/passkeys:software_authenticator)
Rebase risk: medium because FidoDiscoveryFactory has been reshaped several times
Origin: original
Status: HUNKS WRITTEN FROM docs/notes/fido-api-155.md (verbatim 155 source); NOT yet applied on a tree. Builder: apply, fix context lines, build.

--- a/device/fido/fido_discovery_factory.cc
+++ b/device/fido/fido_discovery_factory.cc
@@ case FidoTransportProtocol::kInternal: {
       std::vector<std::unique_ptr<FidoDiscoveryBase>> discoveries;
 #if BUILDFLAG(IS_MAC) || BUILDFLAG(IS_CHROMEOS)
       discoveries = MaybeCreatePlatformDiscovery();
+#elif BUILDFLAG(IS_LINUX)
+      discoveries.push_back(
+          std::make_unique<corvid::passkeys::SoftwareDiscovery>());
 #endif
       return discoveries;
     }

Also at the top of the file:
+#if BUILDFLAG(IS_LINUX)
+#include "corvid/passkeys/software_authenticator.h"
+#endif
and in device/fido/BUILD.gn, under the DEVICE_FIDO component deps:
